      "summary": "Welcome to the Interstitium Labs Esoteric Foundations academy \u2014 IL-01. I\u2019m your instructor for this academy, and over the next three modules we\u2019re going to read the Western esoteric current the way historians read anything: primary sources first, every claim tiered honestly, and belief never required. This is Module 1: Hermetic Foundations \u2014 the current from Alexandria to the present: the Hermetic Corpus (Corpus Hermeticum, Asclepius, Nag Hammadi context, late-antique Alexandria), the Golden Dawn (1888\u20131903 order history, grade system, the LBRP as study object), Wicca and Thelema (Gardnerian origins, Crowley/A.\u2019.\u2019A.\u2019./O.T.O., the Book of the Law), chaos magic and Discordianism (Spare\u2019s sigilization, Carroll\u2019s paradigm shifting, the Principia), Hermetic Qabalah (the Tree of Life, correspondences, tarot), and alchemy (Alexandrian roots, Paracelsus, laboratory vs. spiritual readings) \u2014 every text read through the four epistemic tiers: DOCUMENTED, SCHOLARLY CONSENSUS, TRADITIONAL, CONTESTED.",
