            },
            {
              "text": "DOCUMENTED: what Beer actually built (telex network, VSM, ops room) vs mythologized ('internet before the internet'); the VSM is the serious part \u2014 study that before buying chairs",
              "correct": true,
              "why": "Honest briefing: separate build from myth, theory from furniture."
